# Fixture for the blob-mode prelude-loop tripwire (eu-oaz72.47).
#
# Prelude loops (`foldl`, and `sum` / `count` built on it) are compiled
# into the blob. Before eu-oaz72.47 the blob compiled them without
# resolving intrinsic aliases, so they called the global `if` with thunked
# branches and cost ~1.7x the ticks of the same loops in source mode.
snd(a, b): b

n: 20000

` { target: :tick-parity-prelude-loops }
tick-parity-prelude-loops: [range(0, n) foldl(snd, 0), range(0, n) sum, range(0, n) count]
